{
  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/npbdzob2b1",
  "title": "多个 worktree 实践经验",
  "author": "陈志敏",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/npbdzob2b1_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [],
  "content": "<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">worktree是什么？</h2>\n<div>在<code>vibe coding</code>的过程中经常遇到的一个问题是AI思考和编码的时间太长，这段时间会变得无所事事。有若干消磨时间的办法：</div>\n<ol>\n<li>刷剧、刷SNS</li>\n<li>开发另一个项目</li>\n<li>使用 worktree 新建一个目录继续开发本项目的另一个功能</li>\n</ol>\n<div>worktree 的本质就是把项目复制到另一个目录，我们可以同时对这两个目录的内容进行开发，开发完成之后合并两边的内容即可。</div>\n<div>可以把 worktree 想象成一个 team，不同的程序员在不同的电脑上对同一个项目进行开发，最后把大家的工作成果合并到一起。</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">实践 worktree</h2>\n<div>我通常会保持两个目录进行开发。因为我们是对同一个项目进行开发，过多的 worktree 可能会相互干扰（同时修改了同一个文件），我的脑子也无法支撑这么多线程。</div>\n<div>为了双线开发且不互相干扰，我会把项目分成业务逻辑和 UI 两部分。具体来说就是分成<code>main</code>、<code>develop</code>、<code>feature/ui</code> 三个分支。其中 <code>main</code> 是生产分支，也就是线上的正式版本分支，<code>develop</code> 是业务分支，也是开发主分支，<code>feature/ui</code> 是 UI 分支。</div>\n<div>创建完这三个分支后，为 UI 分支新建 worktree 目录：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>git worktree add </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>ui feature</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>ui</span></code></div></pre>\n<div>现在我们的工作目录会变成这样：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>project</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>\n</span><span>├── </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">git</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">├──</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>develop 分支的代码</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>ui</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">├──</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>feature</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>ui 分支的代码</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span>\n</span></code></div></pre>\n<div>这样我们就可以使用编辑器分别打开 project 和 ui 进行双线开发了，也可以运行两个开发服务器进行预览。</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">同步开发成果</h2>\n<div>当我们在两个分支分别做出一些修改之后，我们需要便捷地同步两边的工作，这时候可以编写一份同步脚本。这份同步脚本要实现以下功能：</div>\n<ol>\n<li>非常方便地同步两个分支的更改，而不需要手动切换分支合并；</li>\n<li>只同步两边已提交的更改，而不用考虑工作区是否还有未提交的更改；</li>\n</ol>\n<div>以下是我的脚本示例，我使用的是 zsh，如果你用 bash 可以把第一行改成 <code>#!/bin/bash</code></div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token hashbang\" style=\"color: slategray;\">#!/usr/bin/env zsh</span><span>\n</span><span>set </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>e\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">UI_DIR</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"../ui\"</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">DID_MERGE</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">false</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"🔄 开始同步流程：feature/ui → develop（merge + stash）\"</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>########### </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">DEVELOP</span><span> 分支处理 ###########\n</span><span>cd </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\"</span><span>  # 保证在 repo 根目录\n</span>\n<span>echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"📦 暂存 develop 中的未提交更改（如果有）...\"</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">DEV_STASHED</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">false</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">if</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>n </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"$(git status --porcelain)\"</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span> then\n</span><span>  git stash push </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>u </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>m </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"sync: stash develop before merge\"</span><span>\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">DEV_STASHED</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">true</span><span>\n</span>fi\n\ngit checkout develop\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">if</span><span> git merge </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">--</span><span>no</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>ff feature</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>ui </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>m </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"merge: feature/ui → develop\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span> then\n</span><span>  echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"✅ 成功将 feature/ui 合并进 develop\"</span><span>\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">DID_MERGE</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">true</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">else</span><span>\n</span><span>  echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"⚠️ 无需合并：develop 已包含 feature/ui\"</span><span>\n</span>fi\n\n<span>echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"🚀 推送 develop 到远程...\"</span><span>\n</span>git push origin develop\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">if</span><span> $</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">DEV_STASHED</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span> then\n</span><span>  echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"🔄 恢复 develop 的未提交更改...\"</span><span>\n</span><span>  git stash pop </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">||</span><span> echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"⚠️ stash pop 时发生冲突，请手动处理\"</span><span>\n</span>fi\n\n<span>########### </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">UI</span><span> 分支处理 ###########\n</span><span>echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"🔁 develop → feature/ui 合并回流中...\"</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>cd </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"$UI_DIR\"</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"📦 暂存 feature/ui 中的未提交更改（如果有）...\"</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">UI_STASHED</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">false</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">if</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>n </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"$(git status --porcelain)\"</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span> then\n</span><span>  git stash push </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>u </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>m </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"sync: stash ui before merge\"</span><span>\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">UI_STASHED</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">true</span><span>\n</span>fi\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">if</span><span> git merge</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>base </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">--</span><span>is</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>ancestor develop </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">HEAD</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span> then\n</span><span>  echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"⚠️ feature/ui 已包含 develop，无需合并\"</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">else</span><span>\n</span><span>  git merge develop </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">--</span><span>no</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>edit\n</span><span>  git push origin feature</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>ui\n</span><span>  echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"✅ 成功将 develop 合并进 feature/ui\"</span><span>\n</span>fi\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">if</span><span> $</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">UI_STASHED</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span> then\n</span><span>  echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"🔄 恢复 feature/ui 的未提交更改...\"</span><span>\n</span><span>  git stash pop </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">||</span><span> echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"⚠️ stash pop 时发生冲突，请手动处理\"</span><span>\n</span>fi\n\n<span>cd </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&gt;</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>dev</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token null nil\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">null</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">if</span><span> $</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">DID_MERGE</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span> then\n</span><span>  echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"✅ 完整同步完成：feature/ui 合并进 develop，develop 合并回 feature/ui\"</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">else</span><span>\n</span><span>  echo </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"✅ 分支已同步，无需更新\"</span><span>\n</span>fi</code></div></pre>\n<div>有了脚本之后，需要运行脚本。我的方案是在 <code>package.json</code> 配置命令。现在上述脚本保存到项目根目录<code>.scripts/sync.sh</code>，然后在 <code>package.json</code> 中的 <code>scripts</code> 添加新命令：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span><span> </span><span class=\"token string-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"scripts\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token string-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"sync\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"chmod +x .scripts/sync.sh &amp;&amp; .scripts/sync.sh\"</span><span>\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span></code></div></pre>\n<div>完成两边的修改之后，在 develop 所在目录运行 <code>npm sync</code> 即可。</div>",
